---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { getReleases } from '../lib/releases';

const releases = await getReleases();
let latestTag = releases[0]?.tag_name || 'v0.0.4-beta.11';

let macDmgUrl = '/api/download?target=mac-dmg';
let macZipUrl = '/api/download?target=mac-zip';
let winSetupUrl = '/api/download?target=win-setup';
let winZipUrl = '/api/download?target=win-zip';
---

<PageLayout title="下载客户端" description="下载适用于 macOS 与 Windows 的 Polyglance 最新直接安装包" lang="zh-CN">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:0.5rem; margin-bottom:1rem;">
      <div class="version-tag-pill">
        <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
        <span>最新版本 <strong id="latest-tag-label">{latestTag}</strong></span>
      </div>
      <div class="version-tag-pill">
        <svg style="width:14px; height:14px; fill:none; stroke:currentColor; stroke-width:2;" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line></svg>
        <span>官网累计下载 <strong id="site-downloads-count">0</strong> 次</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <h1 class="page-title">下载 Polyglance</h1>
    <p class="page-desc">原生体验、轻量高效、免费开源。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="download-cards-grid">
    <!-- macOS Card -->
    <div id="card-macos" class="card platform-card">
      <div class="platform-header">
        <svg style="width:26px; height:26px; fill:currentColor;" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M18.71 19.5c-.83 1.24-1.71 2.45-3.05 2.47-1.34.03-1.77-.79-3.29-.79-1.53 0-2 .77-3.27.82-1.31.05-2.3-1.32-3.14-2.53C4.25 17 2.94 12.45 4.7 9.39c.87-1.52 2.43-2.48 4.12-2.51 1.28-.02 2.5.87 3.29.87.78 0 2.26-1.07 3.81-.91.65.03 2.47.26 3.64 1.98-.09.06-2.17 1.28-2.15 3.81.03 3.02 2.65 4.03 2.68 4.04-.03.07-.42 1.44-1.38 2.83M15.97 4.37c.62-.75 1.04-1.8 1.01-2.87-.96.04-2.12.64-2.8 1.44-.59.68-1.11 1.76-.97 2.8 1.07.08 2.14-.54 2.76-1.37z"/></svg>
        <div style="flex:1;">
          <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;">
            <h2 class="platform-title">macOS</h2>
            <span id="badge-macos-os" class="detected-os-pill" style="display:none;">当前系统推荐</span>
          </div>
          <span class="platform-sub">支持 Apple Silicon (M1~M4) 与 Intel，要求 macOS 14.0+</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="file-group">
        <a id="link-mac-dmg" href={macDmgUrl} class="file-action-btn file-action-primary">
          <div>
            <strong>macOS 磁盘镜像 (.dmg)</strong>
            <span class="file-meta">推荐：直装镜像，拖拽安装，内置 Sparkle 自动更新</span>
          </div>
          <span class="btn-action-label">直接下载 DMG ↓</span>
        </a>

        <a id="link-mac-zip" href={macZipUrl} class="file-action-btn">
          <div>
            <strong>macOS 压缩包 (.zip)</strong>
            <span class="file-meta">便携归档，解压后拖入“应用程序”目录</span>
          </div>
          <span class="btn-action-label">直接下载 ZIP ↓</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="install-tip">
        <strong>提示“已损坏，无法打开”？</strong>在终端执行：<code style="font-family:var(--font-code); background:var(--bg-card); padding:0.1rem 0.35rem; border-radius:4px; border:1px solid var(--border-subtle);">xattr -cr /Applications/Polyglance.app</code>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Windows Card -->
    <div id="card-windows" class="card platform-card">
      <div class="platform-header">
        <svg style="width:26px; height:26px; fill:currentColor;" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M0 0h11.377v11.377H0zm12.623 0H24v11.377H12.623zM0 12.623h11.377V24H0zm12.623 0H24V24H12.623z"/></svg>
        <div style="flex:1;">
          <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;">
            <h2 class="platform-title">Windows</h2>
            <span id="badge-windows-os" class="detected-os-pill" style="display:none;">当前系统推荐</span>
          </div>
          <span class="platform-sub">支持 Windows 10 (1809+) 与 Windows 11 64位</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="file-group">
        <a id="link-win-setup" href={winSetupUrl} class="file-action-btn file-action-primary">
          <div>
            <strong>Windows 安装版 (.exe)</strong>
            <span class="file-meta">推荐：当前用户安装向导，配置快捷方式与无缝检查更新</span>
          </div>
          <span class="btn-action-label">直接下载 EXE ↓</span>
        </a>

        <a id="link-win-zip" href={winZipUrl} class="file-action-btn">
          <div>
            <strong>Windows 便携版 (.zip)</strong>
            <span class="file-meta">绿色免安装包，解压后直接双击 Polyglance.exe</span>
          </div>
          <span class="btn-action-label">直接下载 ZIP ↓</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="install-tip">
        <strong>首次启动提示：</strong>若 SmartScreen 拦截，点击<strong>“更多信息” → “仍要运行”</strong>。
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Historical & More Versions Section -->
  <div class="card history-versions-card">
    <div class="history-left">
      <div class="history-icon-box">
        <svg style="width:22px; height:22px; fill:none; stroke:currentColor; stroke-width:2;" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="history-title">需要历史版本或查看源代码？</h3>
        <p class="history-desc">浏览全部往期 Releases 发行版、更新记录或获取源码归档。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="history-actions">
      <a href="/changelog" class="btn-history">
        查看更新日志 →
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/ldjx7/Polyglance/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-history btn-history-accent">
        <svg style="width:16px; height:16px; fill:currentColor;" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0024 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z"/></svg>
        <span>全部历史版本 (GitHub) ↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</PageLayout>

<script>
  // Client-side realtime download counter and OS detection
  async function refreshStats() {
    try {
      const res = await fetch('/api/stats');
      if (!res.ok) return;
      const data = await res.json();
      const countEl = document.getElementById('site-downloads-count');
      if (countEl && typeof data.total === 'number') {
        countEl.textContent = data.total.toLocaleString();
      }
    } catch {}
  }

  function detectOS() {
    const isWin = /windows|win32/i.test(navigator.userAgent || navigator.platform || '');
    const macBadge = document.getElementById('badge-macos-os');
    const winBadge = document.getElementById('badge-windows-os');
    const macCard = document.getElementById('card-macos');
    const winCard = document.getElementById('card-windows');

    if (isWin) {
      if (winBadge) winBadge.style.display = 'inline-flex';
      if (winCard) winCard.classList.add('card-detected-active');
    } else {
      if (macBadge) macBadge.style.display = 'inline-flex';
      if (macCard) macCard.classList.add('card-detected-active');
    }
  }

  detectOS();
  refreshStats();
</script>

<style>
  .version-tag-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-2);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .pulse-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #10b981;
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px #10b981;
  }

  .download-cards-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.75rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .download-cards-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .platform-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 2.25rem;
  }

  .platform-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .platform-title {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text-1);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .platform-sub {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }

  .file-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .file-action-btn {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    transition: all 0.2s;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .file-action-btn:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
    background: var(--bg-card-hover);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .file-action-primary {
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
    background: var(--bg-card);
  }

  .file-action-btn strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-1);
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .file-meta {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }

  .btn-action-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    white-space: nowrap;
    margin-left: 1rem;
  }

  .install-tip {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-2);
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  /* History Versions Card */
  .history-versions-card {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .history-versions-card {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .history-actions {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }
  }

  .history-left {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .history-icon-box {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--text-2);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .history-title {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-1);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .history-desc {
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .history-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .btn-history {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    padding: 0.65rem 1.15rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none !important;
    color: var(--text-2) !important;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .btn-history:hover {
    color: var(--text-1) !important;
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
    background: var(--bg-card-hover);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .btn-history-accent {
    color: var(--text-1) !important;
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
  }

  .detected-os-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12);
    color: #10b981;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .card-detected-active {
    border-color: var(--accent) !important;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 102, 204, 0.08);
  }
</style>
